From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msado15, msdasql: user and password, OpenSchema (6011)

Connection.Open passes its user and password to the ODBC driver;
Connection.OpenSchema through a new msdasql IDBSchemaRowset; msdasql no
longer prepends DSN=(null), and its accessors accept ADO's bindings (pObject
only matters for DBTYPE_IUNKNOWN); Field values of the small fixed-size
types (DB-ADO).
---
diff --git a/dlls/msado15/connection.c b/dlls/msado15/connection.c
